 if(page==='water'){const facts=['Sunlight helps liquid water evaporate into invisible water vapor.','As air cools, water vapor can condense into tiny droplets, forming clouds.','Water falls as rain or snow. This is precipitation.','Water collects in rivers, lakes, soil and oceans. Some moves underground.','Plants take up water. Water vapor can leave their leaves through transpiration. The cycle has many paths.'];return view('Water cycle',facts[f.water]+(f.upgrades.water?' My engineered water channel is installed.':''),['☀️ → 💧 → ↑','↑ → ☁️','☁️ → 🌧️','🌧️ → 🌊','🌱 → ↑ → ☁️'][f.water],[step('▶ Follow water','water'),go('♻ Reuse farm water','recycle'),back]);}
